    "body": "## Stage 7.15.31 — Escape / Bribe\n\nImplements Oleg's scripted alternative conflict outcome after the DM reply.\n\n- Adds an active **Уйти** action on Oleg's battle chip.\n- Reuses existing Conflict Core escape voting: first fixed result 2:3 (Остаться), second 3:2 (Уйти).\n- Settles each attempt through existing ledgers: 1 money to Oleg via , 1 reputation from player to .\n- Sends the required system-chat and DM follow-ups and emits controller-owned telemetry events.\n- Keeps source/docs mirrors and cache-busted entrypoints aligned.\n\n## Validation\n\n- PASS_STAGE7_15_31_ESCAPE_BRIBE_CONTRACT\n- PASS_STAGE7_15_21_NASTYA_BATTLE_CONTRACT\n- STAGE7_15_FIRST_BATTLE_OK\n-  for all touched JS mirrors\n- mirror parity and \n\nBrowser smoke reached the production-equivalent Stage 7.15 entrypoint and first battle; the full Oleg chain remains pending user/Safari acceptance.",
